WEBVTT

00:05:28.990 --> 00:05:30.683
And that should concern you --

00:05:30.707 --> 00:05:37.266
(Applause and cheers)

00:05:38.589 --> 00:05:39.946
And that should concern you,

00:05:39.970 --> 00:05:42.446
regardless of whether you subscribe.

00:05:42.470 --> 00:05:43.620
Here's why.

00:05:44.176 --> 00:05:47.585
A democracy is a government of the people.

00:05:48.014 --> 00:05:52.490
People are the ultimate source
of power and authority.

00:05:52.919 --> 00:05:55.918
A great local newsroom acts like a mirror.

00:05:55.942 --> 00:05:59.855
Its journalists see the community
and reflect it back.